Notes on label derivation
================================================================================

`tests.jsonl` is the index validation-bench's setup.sh generates from
toml-test's `files-toml-1.0.0` manifest: every line names one
`tests/{valid,invalid}/...` file and its expected `valid`/`invalid` verdict.
The corpus directories and tests.jsonl were copied into llama-variance from
validation-bench/data/specs/toml-1.0/ rather than re-fetched, so the pin
matches whatever validation-bench had at copy time (0ee318a).
